ts or people in sight.", "This is a close-up photograph of rich red roses, each with a dew-like coating of water droplets. The roses are arranged in a grid of four rows and four columns, with each row and column containing a different number of roses. The droplets glisten under the light, enhancing the vividness of the petals. The image has a soft, romantic feel, with the roses appearing almost out of focus in the background, while the foreground is sharp and detailed. The composition is symmetrical and balanced, with the droplets creating a contrast against the vibrant red petals. The overall effect is one of natural beauty and elegance, with a touch of the surreal.<|end_of_text|>"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 167, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 99, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [131, 173], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "width", "slot_index": 1, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [315, 266], "pos": [3337, 430], "widgets_values": [1024, 1024, "nearest-exact", true, 2, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 129, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "get_image_size", "label": "get_image_size", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "get_image_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "height_input"}, "shape": 7, "name": "height_input", "label": "height_input", "type": "INT"}], "flags": {}, "id": 76, "type": "ImageResizeKJ", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ImageResizeKJ"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [134, 177], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [210, 26], "pos": [3397, 241], "widgets_values"